        "subject": "feat: proof viewer in the console; the Owner portal in three tabs",
        "body": "feat: proof viewer in the console; the Owner portal in three tabs\n\n- Payment proof (0136): the console shows the proof where it is decided —\n  an image inline with zoom and a full-size view, a PDF in the browser's\n  viewer, any other type named with a download — always the latest\n  revision, fetched with the session's credentials and shown from memory\n  (blob:, allowed by the console and portal CSP only). Download stays its\n  own action and now saves under the proof's real name.\n- Owner portal: My stores / Pay & renew / History (FR: Mes boutiques /\n  Payer et renouveler / Historique; AR: متاجري / الدفع والتجديد / السجل)\n  instead of one long page. The tab bar stays at the top on a phone with\n  44 px targets; the chosen tab is kept in memory for the visit; an\n  activation link opens My stores with that store's payment.\n- Tests: viewer (image, PDF, unsupported, revision, refusal, CSP); the\n  portal's tests open the tab they read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
